# Resolution in the sidebar's Quality menu, as an iPad's Settings panel has it: the other Mac's, for
# every device. The test host starts at Retina; Standard is chosen, the host answers, and the row says
# so; then back to Retina. The favourites are left as they were (the runner's rule).
wait apps 30
expect stream.resolution == Retina
snap resolution-retina.png
click 110 461
choose Standard
wait standard 5
expect stream.resolution == Standard
snap resolution-standard.png
click 110 461
choose Retina
wait retina 5
expect stream.resolution == Retina
